{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10242","headline":"同阎伯均宿道士观有述 · 包何","name":"同阎伯均宿道士观有述","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南国佳人去不回，洛阳才子更须媒。\n绮琴白雪无心弄，罗幌清风到晓开。\n冉冉修篁依户牖，迢迢列宿映楼台。\n纵令奔月成仙去，且作行云入梦来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包何","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10242.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10242","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}